                <p class="text-muted small">Input what you need to do, set a date, and choose a priority.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <h5>Track Progress</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small">Watch your dashboard update as you complete tasks and hit goals.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
